Spinner: captured free component source. Orbiting light drawn in three layers (a crisp arc, a tight glow and a wide bloom) in five sizes and any text colour, announced as loading.

Primary source: components/base/spinner/spinner.tsx. Exported names: SpinnerSize, SpinnerProps, SpinnerGlyph, Spinner.

Declared npm dependencies: react-aria-components@^1.17.0.

BoardUI registry dependencies: cx. These names refer to source registry items, not npm packages.

Types from the primary source (referenced types may be imported):

```tsx
export type SpinnerSize = "xs" | "sm" | "md" | "lg" | "xl";

export interface SpinnerProps {
  /** 12, 16, 20 (default), 24, or 32px. */
  size?: SpinnerSize;
  /** Draw the faint full circle under the light. Default true. */
  track?: boolean;
  /** Accessible name. Default "Loading". */
  "aria-label"?: string;
  /** Hide it from assistive technology when a parent already announces the wait. */
